  triage:title "Required validation test gaps: legacy-shape fixture coverage and --check failure-naming test" ;
  triage:description "Quality-mgr QA-1 on PR #1014, req-qa B4/B5: two Required validation items from the sprint doc have zero test coverage. (a) No fixture suite covering all four documented legacy shapes (23/25/26/35-key) -- only two same-shape files plus one synthetic v1 mutation exist in test_real_shape_fixtures_preserve_source_bytes_and_metrics(). (b) The --check mode's deliberately-corrupted-fixture-must-fail-naming-the-file requirement (AC3) has zero test coverage; main()/--check mode is never invoked in the test suite." ;
